From 784a37136b4717a060261213533c7908a83d9f08 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 21:27:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat: Add filterViewScore action and --filter-view-score

Remove gaussians that contribute too little to a set of views. Scoring now
works in every renderer tier (streamed scenes total on the CPU) and counts
in 64 bits, so scores no longer depend on the image size.

